      "chunk_text": "Aarav Sharma called to inquire about his auto insurance policy, suspecting it had expired. Agent Suresh Deshmukh confirmed the policy expired on March 10th. Aarav expressed surprise at not receiving a notification. Suresh offered to renew the policy immediately over the phone and committed to updating Aarav's contact information to ensure future notifications are received.",
